[?2004l[?2004h> # DFIR Investigation Progress and Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Investigation Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 03:20 UTC**: SOC incident ticket opened (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`). Initial alerts noted for dropper, cron persistence, and postgres baseline configuration weakness (`/sas/alerts.json`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Phase 1: Initial Assessment & Triage**: Analyzed security alerts (`/sas/alerts.json`), baseline check (`/sas/baseline.json`), and vulnerability report (`/sas/vulns.json`). Reviewed CTI advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Phase 2: Evidence Deep Dive on Forensic Image (`/disk`)**: Identified missing silent persistence and C2 channels omitted from automated alerting:
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Database entry point: Unrestricted `trust` authentication configured in `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf`.
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Execution & Dropper: Binary dropped at `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` (SHA256: `c7e7e38fa8ffb3ba9b679b14d14ba7196d89d0c691c53f6bac576dee284cd603`). M[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[K.
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Cron Persistence: Malicious periodic re-dropper beacon located in `/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres`.
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Systemd Persistence: Silent persistence systemd unit installed at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service`.
[?2004l[?2004h>   - DNS Tunneling / C2: DNS exfiltration configuration discovered at `/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf` and partial C2 beacon recovered from `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`.
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Anti-Forensics: Timestomping metadata record found at `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps`.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Phase 3: Change Ticket Reconciliation**: Corrected stale/incorrect entries in `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` using on-disk evidence.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Phase 4: Final Deliverables Generation**: Drafted comprehensive reports across all five required files under `/app`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Working Checklist
